><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>2.  Click on Projects on the Navigator after entering the Admin area.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>3.  You will see a list of projects on the right for which you have been identified as the PI.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>4.  Double click on one of these projects.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>5.  You are now in the Project view for one of your projects.  Listed in this view is:</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='3' leftmargin='1.5000in' rightmargin='93%' list='bullet'/>
<par def='3'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Project name and number</run></par>
<par def='3'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>A short description</run></par>
<par def='3'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>PI</run></par>
<par def='3'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Section Head</run></par>
<par def='3'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Employees who have access to the project for placing orders</run></par>
<par def='3'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Budget information including funds committed</run></par>
<par def='3'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Persons who have credit cards (M/C, VISA) or financial signing authority (PO) on this project</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>6.  Review this information and any changes you wish to make can be made by obtaining approval from the Section Head (Dr. Renaud Vincent) and then contacting the database managers (Josée Guénette; Patrick Goegan).</run></par></richtext></item>
<item name='HelpFHelpText'><richtext>
<pardef id='4' leftmargin='0.8125in' rightmargin='93%'/>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>En tant que CP, voici comment retracer vos projets :</run></par>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>1.	Cliquez sur la touche</run><run
><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/> </run><run
><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Admin</run><run
><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/> </run><run
><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>pour entrer dans la section administrative de la base de données.</run></par>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>		</run><picture
